me": "Thumbnail-Announcement-Meta.png", "id": "564085896669965", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491827038_564085900003298_2050004744367679070_n.png?_nc_cat=111&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=C6XpFrOZ6RMQ7kNvwFW1Vor&_nc_oc=AdoHmZW1pb0ZIlftYnULwkh-5AekWK-3KAjDnnrRSJDMjZF_5THhoow5AYuAjfOart4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQR2uDwgmE0lD_bLrFcjnD0LOE5-RL-VTKuVtbYxzSTZIQ&oe=6B0DCA60"}, "display_name": "VEX MAGE", "keywords": ["FastPaced", "BulletHell", "Spellcasting", "Coop", "MovementBased"], "long_description": "Twin elements. Infinite momentum. Danger from every direction. \n\nMerge spells, cross dimensions, and dance through deadly arenas in this lightning-fast shooter. Alone or together - Claim your immortality on cross-platform leaderboards. Your name is eternal.\n\n\n* **Vexatious Combat:** Enemies strike from all sides - survive by mastering your movement and aggression.\n* **Combine The Elements:** Assign elemental runes to each hand and fuse them for devastating results.\n* **Fast-Fire Sessions:** Dive into a rapid-fire campaign of levels that explode with speed, chaos, and pure adrenaline. \n* **Co-op & Solo:** Fight alone or with up to two allies. The challenge adapts, so every run is a test of survival.\n* **Global Leaderboards:** Leave your mark - fight your way up the global leaderboards, where only the deadliest rise to the top. ", "short_description": "Twin elements. Infinite momentum. Danger from every direction. \n\nMerge spells, cross dimensions, and dance through deadly arenas in this lightning-fast shooter. Alone or together - Claim your immortality on cross-platform leaderboards. Your name is eternal."}]}, "developer_name": "Nervous Systems LLC", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.nervous-systems.com/privacy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Fast Travel Games", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://nervous-syst